  "semantic_fragments": [
    {
      "fragment_type": "scope_limitation",
      "content": "The Infrared Forehead Thermometer is intended for the intermittent measurement of body temperature from the forehead skin surface on people of all ages. It can be used by consumers in the household environment and by health care providers. The device consists of the following parts: The product consists of an infrared probe assembly, a main circuit board assembly, an LCD display assembly, and a shell assembly.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "预期用途",
        "适用人群",
        "使用环境",
        "产品组成"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT2L",
        "Infrared Forehead Thermometer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "design_rationale",
      "content": "PT2L replaced the MCU with a smaller memory in hardware to ensure that the new MCU has sufficient performance and functions while meeting cost requirements. Re-evaluated the structural design in structure to find parts that can be simplified or optimized to reduce the amount of materials used. Software code was written to adapt to the new MCU.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "设计变更",
        "MCU更换",
        "结构优化",
        "软件适配",
        "成本控制"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT2L",
        "设计变更"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "At the same time as the PT2L infrared thermometer project was established, we planned risk management activities for the product and formulated a risk management plan. The risk management plan determined the risk acceptance criteria for the PT2L infrared thermometer and arranged the review of the product's risk management activities. The company formed a risk management team to ensure that the risk management activities of the project were effectively implemented in accordance with the risk management plan. In the early development and prototype stages of the PT2L infrared thermometer, the risk management team conducted a risk management review and formed relevant risk management documents. While the PT2L infrared thermometer was undergoing design changes, the company formed a risk management team to ensure that the risk management activities for the design changes of the project were effectively implemented in accordance with the risk management plan. The members of the risk management team conducted risk analysis, risk assessment and risk control of the design changes of the product, as well as the acceptability assessment of the comprehensive residual risks, and confirmed that the design changes did not generate new risks and had no impact on the original risks.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "风险管理实施",
        "设计变更",
        "风险分析",
        "风险评估",
        "风险控制",
        "残余风险"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT2L",
        "风险管理计划",
        "风险管理团队"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "The risk management team checked the completion of the risk management plan one by one. Through the inspection of relevant risk management documents, it was considered that the risk management activities for the design change of PT2L infrared thermometer have been basically implemented. The residual risk has been reviewed in Verification of risk control measure and Residual Risk Evaluation Report, and the results of the residual risks are accepted.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "风险管理评审",
        "设计变更",
        "残余风险接受",
        "风险管理计划完成情况"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT2L",
        "PT2L-FXYS01 V1.0",
        "风险管理评审"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "Please refer to 'Table of getting information of Production and after Production' from the Risk Management Control Methods (Version: E/0). After the evaluation on the fitness and effectiveness, the risk management Group decided that, the method is appropriate and effective, PT2L can get the information on production and after production with this method, and the Group can perform dynamic risk management when necessary.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "生产后信息",
        "上市后监测",
        "动态风险管理",
        "风险管理控制方法"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
